{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene is anchored by a camera positioned on the top side. For every pen in the image, there is a screwdriver to its left, a glove to its right, and a spoon positioned to the right of the glove. The screwdriver, pen, glove, and spoon are arranged in a row and aligned horizontally. Additionally, the camera is physically larger than the pen.",
